⚠️ Limitations of NumPy

* Not ideal for labeled data
* Limited data manipulation compared to Pandas
* Not suitable for very large out-of-memory datasets

----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

🧠 Best Practices

* Use NumPy arrays instead of lists for numerical data
* Avoid loops; use vectorization
* Use appropriate data types to save memory
* Combine NumPy with Pandas for data analysis

